v2_gate,v2_name,v2_rule_summary,v2_failure_state,audit_finding,v3_disposition,v3_gate_name,v3_requirement,evidence_needed,computational_boundary,physical_boundary,migration_state
G0,Canonical lock,"Formula ID, version, target class, inventory version, source manifest, formula hash, worker packet ID.",HOLD,Useful and executable. Inventory must not be mandatory for target-only complexity audits.,RETAIN_AND_SPLIT_SCOPE,Canonical identity and provenance lock,Hard gate for all artifacts; inventory lock required only for a build or physical batch.,source manifest; hashes; artifact scope,PASS possible computationally.,No physical requirement.,DIRECT_MIGRATION_WITH_SCOPE_FIX
G1,Stock and identity,Exact stock/solvent/active fraction and no gap or unconfirmed material.,REBUILD OR STOCK HOLD,"Conflates target identity with build executability, contrary to target/inventory separation.",SPLIT,G1A target identity integrity / G1B build-stock executability,G1A hard for all target claims. G1B hard only for build or physical-batch claims.,identity evidence; inventory authority for G1B,G1A can be desk-audited; G1B needs authoritative inventory.,Actual stock preparation/lot remains physical provenance.,MIGRATE_TO_TWO_SUBGATES
G2,Arithmetic,"Exactly 1,000 parts; correct batch calculations; no unresolved sub-resolution dose; carrier correction.",FAIL,"Strong deterministic gate, but not applicable to architecture-only records without amounts.",RETAIN_CONDITIONALLY,Arithmetic and measurable execution,Hard for quantified target/build formulas; NOT_APPLICABLE for architecture-only records.,formula amounts; stock fractions; densities if volumetric,Deterministic scripts can pass arithmetic.,Actual dispensing accuracy remains physical/measurement evidence.,DIRECT_MIGRATION
G3,Meaningful row count,At least 50 distinct odor materials for accord; 65 for perfume; microtexture <=20%.,REBUILD,The universal minima conflict with ingredient-count-as-outcome. The anti-padding parts are valuable.,REPLACE_CORE_KEEP_LEGACY_BANDS,Anti-compression and anti-padding,Hard when an authoritative roster or function graph creates a target-specific minimum; otherwise 50/65 are legacy compatibility bands and compression-review triggers. Microtexture reliance remains blocking.,deduplicated rows; required identities; function graph; ablation,"Desk audit can detect duplicates, padding, and roster loss.",Physical omission required before unconfirmed microtexture contributes.,REQUIRES_RECLASSIFICATION
G4,Functional coverage,"At least 5 systems, 3 phases, 6 bridge/cross-module materials, late-drydown and anti-defect mechanisms.",REVISE,Valuable but one universal profile is unsuitable for legitimate compact work.,MAKE_CLASS_SPECIFIC,Vector coverage profile,"Thresholds become class definitions: compact has no breadth minimum; layered, high-complexity, and orchestral have increasing noncompensatory profiles.",row functions; systems; phases; bridges,Designed coverage computable.,Perceived integration and late identity require physical sensory work.,MIGRATE_TO_D1_D2_D4_D5_D6
G5,Interaction coherence,Major modules mapped; bridges connect both systems; risks documented; no note-only justification.,REVISE,Core rule is sound. Atlas hypotheses must not be upgraded to observations.,RETAIN_AND_EVIDENCE_QUALIFY,Interaction coherence,"Each edge stores evidence state. Proposed-only edges can support a test plan, not empirical interaction claims.",interaction records; evidence class,Graph coverage computable.,Actual enhancement/suppression/configuration requires controlled blends.,MIGRATE_TO_D3
G6,Dominance control,"Fixed 22%, 35%, 45%, and 35% limits for material/wood/musk/amberwood.",REVISE OR REBUILD,"Fixed thresholds are arbitrary across perfume families, potency, stock basis, and target architecture.",CONVERT_TO_DIAGNOSTIC_WITH_TARGET_SPECIFIC_HARD_BOUNDS,Dominance and dependency diagnostics,Always report concentration and functional dominance. Hard limits require target-specific evidence or an approved design brief. Single-point recognizer dependency remains blocking.,active-basis composition; role graph; target evidence,Concentration and dependency diagnostics computable.,Perceived dominance requires sensory evaluation.,REQUIRES_RECALIBRATION
G7,Temporal architecture,"Opening, heart, drydown, 8-hour recognizer, 24-hour residue hypothesis, transition support.",REVISE,Designed phase coverage is useful; 8/24-hour claims cannot pass computationally.,SPLIT_DESIGN_FROM_OBSERVATION,Temporal design and observed evolution,Designed windows/transitions may pass as design. 8/24-hour recognizer or residue is HOLD until standardized observation.,phase roles; release evidence; timepoint records,Phase graph and model hypotheses computable.,Actual time-course and residue require repeated observation.,MIGRATE_TO_D4
G8,Monte Carlo robustness,10k/20k simulations and >=90% hard-gate pass probability.,CONDITIONAL / REBUILD,Run counts and pass threshold are not universal; simulation cannot rescue invented distributions or empirical gaps.,REPLACE_WITH_PROVENANCE_AND_CONVERGENCE_RULES,Computational uncertainty and empirical resilience,"Require documented uncertainty sources, model domain, convergence/sensitivity, and noncompensatory failure reporting. No universal pass probability.",parameter provenance; uncertainty model,Computational sensitivity can pass its own scope.,Physical resilience requires replicate batches and repeated evaluation.,MIGRATE_TO_D7
G9,Material ablation,Remove every row; classify; prune; rerun gates; falling below 50/65 requires rebuild.,REBUILD,Computational ablation is valuable but cannot establish perceptual irrelevance. Rebuilding solely to restore row count encourages padding.,RETAIN_WITH_PHYSICAL_BOUNDARY,Effective post-ablation complexity,Computationally prune clear duplicates and unsupported rows. Uncertain sensory rows become provisional and do not count until physical omission. Reclassify rather than pad.,ablation ledger; dependency graph,Model ablation computable.,Perceptual contribution requires omission testing.,MIGRATE_TO_D8
G10,Dose perturbation,±10/20/30% for major controls; classify fragility and hazards.,N/A stated,"Useful default grid, but dose windows should reflect potency, stock form, and decision.",RETAIN_AS_DEFAULT_NOT_UNIVERSAL,Perturbation and control fragility,Use declared dose grid or justified alternative. Separate computational sensitivity from physical odor response.,dose rationale; perturbation plan,Arithmetic/model sensitivity computable.,Odor hazard and restoration effects require physical tests.,MIGRATE_TO_D7_D8
G11,Anti-collapse,Sibling comparison; collision similarity <0.76; JSD threshold; no concentration/top-only distinction; no cloned chassis.,REBUILD OR MERGE,Anti-collapse is essential; universal numerical similarity thresholds are uncalibrated.,RETAIN_REMOVE_UNCALIBRATED_DEFAULTS,Sibling anti-collapse,"Require multi-view identity, structural, temporal, recognizer, and drydown comparison. Numerical thresholds are model-specific and must be calibrated.",sibling vector records; lineage,Structural comparisons computable.,Actual distinctness needs blind sensory comparison.,MIGRATE_TO_D1_D4_D6
G12,Physical chemistry,"Solubility, precipitation, haze, oxidation, resin load, color, compatibility, aging, storage.",FORMULATION HOLD,Correctly physical and noncompensatory. Some risks can be source-screened but not empirically passed.,RETAIN_HARD_HOLD,Physical chemistry readiness,Desk work may flag risks. PASS for a physical build requires source documents and/or observed preparation/stability evidence.,supplier docs; matrix; batch observations,Only risk screen computable.,Physical preparation and stability evidence required.,DIRECT_MIGRATION_WITH_PASS_CAP
G13,Evidence integrity,Notes not direct molecules; source all claims; patents/public formulas limited; computed headspace/OAV boundaries; no invented product-basis fraction.,EVIDENCE HOLD,Core authority firewall.,RETAIN_AND_EXPAND,Evidence integrity,"Add explicit evidence states: source-derived, computed, proposed, physical observation, trained sensory, unknown.",claim-to-source records,Desk audit can pass evidence labeling and provenance.,Empirical claims still require empirical records.,DIRECT_MIGRATION
G14,Final quality gate,"Weighted 100-point score, minimum 92, hard failures override.",PASS / CONDITIONAL / HOLD / REBUILD,"The score invites compensation and mixes evidence, execution, architecture, robustness, and physical readiness. It cannot measure beauty.",REPLACE_WEIGHTED_SCORE,Noncompensatory release profile,No overall quality score. Report every gate and vector dimension separately; class and claim level are capped by the weakest required boundary. Hedonic data are separate.,all gate/vector records,No formula-only final quality claim.,"Beauty, broad appeal, and similarity require claim-appropriate sensory evidence.",REBUILD_SUMMARY_LOGIC
